# ── PDFs distributed with solver dirs (copyright; keep local) ─
finite/fBNAfm/SRBM*in*Hypercube.pdf
finite/fBNAfm/the-finite-element-method.pdf
finite/fBNAsm/SRBM*in*Hypercube.pdf
finite/fBNAsm/the-finite-element-method.pdf
